## $\displaystyle \Gamma _0 = \alpha _0: x \in \mathbb{R}, \langle\text{static}\rangle\ a \in \mathbb{R}, \langle\text{static}\rangle\ b \in \mathbb{R}$

$\displaystyle \mathbf{ctx}\ \langle \text{换元法} \rangle: u = a x + b$
$\displaystyle \color{Grey} \text{d} u = a \ \text{d} x$
$\displaystyle \text{d} x = \frac{1}{a} \ \text{d} u$
$\displaystyle x = \frac{u - b}{a}$

## $\displaystyle \Gamma _1 = \alpha _1: \alpha _0 + \langle \text{换元法} \rangle$

$\displaystyle \int x ^2 \sqrt{a x + b} \ \text{d} x$
$\displaystyle = \int \left( \frac{u - b}{a} \right) ^2 \cdot \sqrt{u} \cdot \frac{1}{a} \ \text{d} u$
$\displaystyle = \frac{1}{a ^3} \int (u - b) ^2 u ^{1/2} \ \text{d} u$
$\displaystyle = \frac{1}{a ^3} \int \left( u ^2 - 2 b u + b ^2 \right) u ^{1/2} \ \text{d} u$
$\displaystyle = \frac{1}{a ^3} \int \left( u ^{5/2} - 2 b u ^{3/2} + b ^2 u ^{1/2} \right) \ \text{d} u$

$\displaystyle [\mathbb{R}::int]\ \mathbf{ori}\ C \in \mathbb R$
$\displaystyle = \frac{1}{a ^3} \left( \frac{u ^{7/2}}{7/2} - 2 b \frac{u ^{5/2}}{5/2} + b ^2 \frac{u ^{3/2}}{3/2} \right) + \color{Cyan} C$
$\displaystyle = \frac{1}{a ^3} \left( \frac{2}{7} u ^{7/2} - \frac{4 b}{5} u ^{5/2} + \frac{2 b ^2}{3} u ^{3/2} \right) + C$

## $\displaystyle \Gamma _1 = \Gamma _0 + \langle \text{换元法} \rangle$

$\displaystyle = \frac{1}{a ^3} \left( \frac{2}{7} (a x + b) ^{7/2} - \frac{4 b}{5} (a x + b) ^{5/2} + \frac{2 b ^2}{3} (a x + b) ^{3/2} \right) + C$
